0..80 Comment "/// This source prints a transport whose motive starts away from its moved path."
81..84 Comment "///"
85..162 Comment "/// A matching motive start lets the printer show a transport as a composite."
163..227 Comment "/// A different motive start requires the full transport syntax."
228..231 Comment "///"
232..304 Comment "/// The printer reads the moved path start before it chooses a spelling."
305..367 Comment "/// The path does not determine the spelling for every motive."
368..371 Comment "///"
372..410 Comment "/// - see: #4218 — transport printer"
411..449 Comment "/// - see: #754 — returned composite"
